Neo Geo SDK · sound/ssg/
========================

SSG (Software-controlled Sound Generator) configuration and presets.

The YM2610 has 3 SSG channels (square / noise / envelope) inherited
from the AY-3-8910 lineage.  This directory holds preset definitions
that the SDK loads with `soundSetSSGPreset(uint8_t preset)`.

Track IDs (sdk/sound_ids.h)
---------------------------

  SOUND_SSG_BATTLE_STING   = 0
  SOUND_SSG_MENU_LOOP      = 1
  SOUND_SSG_INSERT_COIN    = 2
  SOUND_SSG_ARCADE_ALERT   = 3

Presets are bound via:

  soundSetSSGPreset(preset_id);
  playSSGTrack(SOUND_SSG_*);

Build
-----

  make ssgconfig    # rebuild SSG configuration
  make ssg          # rebuild SSG track tables
  make sound        # full audio pipeline

v1.3.1
------

  - Chapter 18 of the unified demo (SSG ARCADE / EAGLE INVADERS) plays
    SOUND_SSG_ARCADE_ALERT in a pure-SSG mix (FM volume 0).  Z80
    commands are spaced by a vblank each so the driver can apply
    `soundApplyMix` + `soundSetSSGPreset` + `playSSGTrack` cleanly.
